SUMMARY:Part Closure: WEAVER LINE: Saturday 26 September\, all day\, and 
 Sunday 27 September\, from 1015\, no service between Hackney Downs and 
 Cheshunt / Enfield Town. The limited number of GREATER ANGLIA and STANSTED
  EXPRESS trains which usually stop at Seven Sisters will stop at Tottenham
  Hale instead. Use London Underground connections between Central London 
 and Seven Sisters\, and for Rectory Road and Stoke Newington\, use Clapton
  station. If travelling to the Big Bang concert at Tottenham Hotspur 
 Stadium\, please use Victoria line trains to/from Seven Sisters or 
 Tottenham Hale.
END:VEVENT
